msgid "[Readonly properties](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.properties.php#language.oop5.properties.readonly-properties)"
msgstr "[Propiedades de solo lectura](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.properties.php#language.oop5.properties.readonly-properties)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "[Readonly classes](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.basic.php#language.oop5.basic.class.readonly)"
msgstr "[Clases de solo lectura](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.basic.php#language.oop5.basic.class.readonly)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "[Constructor property promotion](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.decon.php#language.oop5.decon.constructor.promotion)"
msgstr "[Promoción de propiedades en el constructor](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.oop5.decon.php#language.oop5.decon.constructor.promotion)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "[Attributes](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.attributes.php)"
msgstr "[Atributos](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.attributes.php)"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Run static analysis and tests on Yii 2.0 before reusing code in Yii3. Code with explicit types, small services, and few implicit `Yii::$app` dependencies is easier to understand and easier to place in the new application."
msgstr "Ejecuta el análisis estático y las pruebas en Yii 2.0 antes de reutilizar código en Yii3. El código con tipos explícitos, servicios pequeños y pocas dependencias implícitas de `Yii::$app` es más fácil de entender y de ubicar en la nueva aplicación."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 applications commonly keep framework roles in top-level directories:"
msgstr "Las aplicaciones Yii 2.0 suelen organizar los roles del framework en directorios de primer nivel:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"assets/\n"
"commands/\n"
"config/\n"
"controllers/\n"
"models/\n"
"runtime/\n"
"views/\n"
"web/\n"
"widgets/\n"
msgstr ""
"assets/\n"
"commands/\n"
"config/\n"
"controllers/\n"
"models/\n"
"runtime/\n"
"views/\n"
"web/\n"
"widgets/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The Yii 2.0 advanced template splits the same roles by application:"
msgstr "La plantilla avanzada de Yii 2.0 divide esos mismos roles por aplicación:"

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"backend/\n"
"common/\n"
"console/\n"
"frontend/\n"
msgstr ""
"backend/\n"
"common/\n"
"console/\n"
"frontend/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The current Yii3 application template is organized around source code, configuration, public files, and runtime files:"
msgstr "La plantilla de aplicación actual de Yii3 se organiza en torno al código fuente, la configuración, los archivos públicos y los archivos de tiempo de ejecución:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Yii 2.0 basic | Yii 2.0 advanced | Yii3 |\n"
"|---------------|------------------|------|\n"
"| `controllers/` | `frontend/controllers/`, `backend/controllers/` | `src/Web/*/Action.php` or controller-like classes |\n"
"| `models/` | `common/models/`, app-specific models | `src/Domain`, `src/Shared`, `src/Web/*`, or `src/Db` by responsibility |\n"
"| `views/` | `frontend/views/`, `backend/views/` | templates near the feature, for example `src/Web/HomePage/template.php` |\n"
"| `views/layouts/` | app layout directories | layout classes/templates, for example `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main` |\n"
"| `assets/` | app asset bundles | `assets/` for source files and `src/Web/.../*Asset.php` for bundles |\n"
"| `web/` | `frontend/web/`, `backend/web/` | `public/` |\n"
"| `commands/` | `console/controllers/` | `src/Console/*Command.php` |\n"
"| `config/*.php` | app and common config files | `config/common`, `config/web`, `config/console`, `config/environments` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Yii 2.0 básica | Yii 2.0 avanzada | Yii3 |\n"
"|---------------|------------------|------|\n"
"| `controllers/` | `frontend/controllers/`, `backend/controllers/` | `src/Web/*/Action.php` o clases similares a controladores |\n"
"| `models/` | `common/models/`, modelos específicos de cada aplicación | `src/Domain`, `src/Shared`, `src/Web/*` o `src/Db`, según la responsabilidad |\n"
"| `views/` | `frontend/views/`, `backend/views/` | plantillas junto a la funcionalidad, por ejemplo `src/Web/HomePage/template.php` |\n"
"| `views/layouts/` | directorios de layouts de cada aplicación | clases/plantillas de layout, por ejemplo `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main` |\n"
"| `assets/` | paquetes de assets de cada aplicación | `assets/` para los archivos fuente y `src/Web/.../*Asset.php` para los paquetes |\n"
"| `web/` | `frontend/web/`, `backend/web/` | `public/` |\n"
"| `commands/` | `console/controllers/` | `src/Console/*Command.php` |\n"
"| `config/*.php` | archivos de configuración comunes y de cada aplicación | `config/common`, `config/web`, `config/console`, `config/environments` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "There is no single required layout. The important change is that Yii3 applications should group code by responsibility and make dependencies explicit. If you are coming from the advanced template, treat `frontend` and `backend` as separate web contexts. Shared domain code can live in `src/Shared` or in application-specific packages."
msgstr "No hay una única estructura obligatoria. El cambio importante es que las aplicaciones Yii3 deben agrupar el código por responsabilidad y hacer explícitas las dependencias. Si vienes de la plantilla avanzada, trata `frontend` y `backend` como contextos web independientes. El código de dominio compartido puede estar en `src/Shared` o en paquetes específicos de la aplicación."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Composer and autoloading"
msgstr "Composer y autocarga"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 applications usually require `vendor/autoload.php` and `vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php` in `web/index.php`.  Yii3 applications require only Composer's autoloader and application bootstrap code."
msgstr "Las aplicaciones Yii 2.0 suelen incluir `vendor/autoload.php` y `vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php` en `web/index.php`. Las aplicaciones Yii3 solo incluyen el cargador automático de Composer y el código de arranque de la aplicación."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Then rebuild Composer autoload files:"
msgstr "Después, vuelve a generar los archivos de autocarga de Composer:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Install Yii3 packages intentionally. Yii3 is split into focused packages, so features such as database access, forms, validation, assets, data widgets, authentication, and caching are separate Composer dependencies."
msgstr "Instala los paquetes de Yii3 de forma deliberada. Yii3 está dividido en paquetes especializados, así que funcionalidades como el acceso a bases de datos, los formularios, la validación, los assets, los widgets de datos, la autenticación y la caché son dependencias de Composer independientes."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration and services"
msgstr "Configuración y servicios"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii 2.0, many services are configured as application components and accessed through the service locator:"
msgstr "En Yii 2.0, muchos servicios se configuran como componentes de la aplicación y se accede a ellos a través del localizador de servicios:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$cache = Yii::$app->cache;\n"
"$db = Yii::$app->db;\n"
"$url = Yii::$app->urlManager->createUrl(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"
msgstr ""
"$cache = Yii::$app->cache;\n"
"$db = Yii::$app->db;\n"
"$url = Yii::$app->urlManager->createUrl(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, services are configured for the container and injected where they are needed:"
msgstr "En Yii3, los servicios se configuran para el contenedor y se inyectan allí donde se necesitan:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ConnectionInterface $db,\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Db\\Connection\\ConnectionInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class PostService\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ConnectionInterface $db,\n"
"        private CacheInterface $cache,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Move configuration in groups:"
msgstr "Traslada la configuración por grupos:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "aliases to `config/common/aliases.php`;"
msgstr "los alias, a `config/common/aliases.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "route definitions to `config/common/routes.php`;"
msgstr "las definiciones de rutas, a `config/common/routes.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "shared service definitions to `config/common/di/*.php`;"
msgstr "las definiciones de servicios compartidas, a `config/common/di/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "web-only service definitions to `config/web/di/*.php`;"
msgstr "las definiciones de servicios exclusivas de la web, a `config/web/di/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "console parameters and commands to `config/console/*.php`;"
msgstr "los parámetros y comandos de consola, a `config/console/*.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "shared parameters to `config/common/params.php`;"
msgstr "los parámetros compartidos, a `config/common/params.php`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "environment overrides to `config/environments`."
msgstr "las sobrescrituras por entorno, a `config/environments`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The default template's `di-console` group reuses shared definitions from `config/common/di/*.php`. If you need console-only container definitions, add the corresponding files to the `di-console` group in `config/configuration.php` and rebuild the merge plan."
msgstr "El grupo `di-console` de la plantilla predeterminada reutiliza las definiciones compartidas de `config/common/di/*.php`. Si necesitas definiciones del contenedor exclusivas de la consola, añade los archivos correspondientes al grupo `di-console` en `config/configuration.php` y vuelve a generar el plan de fusión."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entry script and bootstrap"
msgstr "Script de entrada y arranque"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii 2.0 basic entry script commonly creates the application directly:"
msgstr "Un script de entrada de la plantilla básica de Yii 2.0 suele crear la aplicación directamente:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"defined('YII_DEBUG') or define('YII_DEBUG', true);\n"
"defined('YII_ENV') or define('YII_ENV', 'dev');\n"
"\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/autoload.php';\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php';\n"
"\n"
"$config = require __DIR__ . '/../config/web.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new yii\\web\\Application($config))->run();\n"
msgstr ""
"defined('YII_DEBUG') or define('YII_DEBUG', true);\n"
"defined('YII_ENV') or define('YII_ENV', 'dev');\n"
"\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/autoload.php';\n"
"require __DIR__ . '/../vendor/yiisoft/yii2/Yii.php';\n"
"\n"
"$config = require __DIR__ . '/../config/web.php';\n"
"\n"
"(new yii\\web\\Application($config))->run();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, use the application template entry script as the source of truth. It loads Composer and bootstraps the configured application runner. Avoid recreating the old `yii\\web\\Application` pattern in `public/index.php`; put configuration in config files and dependencies in the container."
msgstr "En Yii3, toma como referencia el script de entrada de la plantilla de aplicación. Carga Composer y arranca el ejecutor (runner) de la aplicación configurado. Evita recrear el antiguo patrón `yii\\web\\Application` en `public/index.php`; pon la configuración en los archivos de configuración y las dependencias en el contenedor."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Controllers, actions, and routing"
msgstr "Controladores, acciones y enrutamiento"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 routes usually point to controller action methods:"
msgstr "En Yii 2.0, las rutas suelen apuntar a métodos de acción de controladores:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace app\\controllers;\n"
"\n"
"use yii\\web\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"final class SiteController extends Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionIndex(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->render('index');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace app\\controllers;\n"
"\n"
"use yii\\web\\Controller;\n"
"\n"
"final class SiteController extends Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionIndex(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->render('index');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 does not require controller base classes. The current application template uses invokable action classes:"
msgstr "Yii3 no requiere clases base de controlador. La plantilla de aplicación actual usa clases de acción invocables:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Web\\HomePage;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Web\\HomePage;\n"
"\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\WebViewRenderer;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class Action\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private WebViewRenderer $viewRenderer,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/template');\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Routes are explicit:"
msgstr "Las rutas son explícitas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "When redesigning a controller flow, list all Yii 2.0 actions and create named routes for the flows you still need.  Then implement each flow as an invokable class or a controller-like service. Constructor injection replaces calls to `Yii::$app` and controller properties."
msgstr "Al rediseñar el flujo de un controlador, enumera todas las acciones de Yii 2.0 y crea rutas con nombre para los flujos que todavía necesites. Después, implementa cada flujo como una clase invocable o como un servicio similar a un controlador. La inyección por constructor sustituye a las llamadas a `Yii::$app` y a las propiedades del controlador."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requests, responses, sessions, and cookies"
msgstr "Solicitudes, respuestas, sesiones y cookies"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 actions often read request data and write response data through application components:"
msgstr "Las acciones de Yii 2.0 suelen leer los datos de la solicitud y escribir los de la respuesta a través de componentes de la aplicación:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$id = Yii::$app->request->get('id');\n"
"Yii::$app->session->setFlash('success', 'Saved.');\n"
"\n"
"return $this->redirect(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"
msgstr ""
"$id = Yii::$app->request->get('id');\n"
"Yii::$app->session->setFlash('success', 'Saved.');\n"
"\n"
"return $this->redirect(['post/view', 'id' => $id]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 uses PSR-7 request and response objects and injectable services:"
msgstr "Yii3 usa objetos de solicitud y respuesta PSR-7 y servicios inyectables:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class SavePostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = (int) ($request->getQueryParams()['id'] ?? 0);\n"
"        $url = $this->urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $id]);\n"
"\n"
"        return $this->responseFactory\n"
"            ->createResponse(Status::SEE_OTHER)\n"
"            ->withHeader('Location', $url);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ResponseFactoryInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\Http\\Message\\ServerRequestInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Http\\Status;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class SavePostAction\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private ResponseFactoryInterface $responseFactory,\n"
"        private UrlGeneratorInterface $urlGenerator,\n"
"    ) {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function __invoke(ServerRequestInterface $request): ResponseInterface\n"
"    {\n"
"        $id = (int) ($request->getQueryParams()['id'] ?? 0);\n"
"        $url = $this->urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $id]);\n"
"\n"
"        return $this->responseFactory\n"
"            ->createResponse(Status::SEE_OTHER)\n"
"            ->withHeader('Location', $url);\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Design request handling early because it affects forms, filters, REST endpoints, redirects, and tests."
msgstr "Diseña pronto el manejo de las solicitudes, porque afecta a los formularios, los filtros, los endpoints REST, las redirecciones y las pruebas."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Views, layouts, assets, and URLs"
msgstr "Vistas, layouts, assets y URL"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii 2.0, controller rendering finds files under `views/{controller}` and layouts under `views/layouts`:"
msgstr "En Yii 2.0, el renderizado del controlador busca los archivos en `views/{controller}` y los layouts en `views/layouts`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return $this->render('view', [\n"
"    'model' => $model,\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"return $this->render('view', [\n"
"    'model' => $model,\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, the template path is explicit in the action:"
msgstr "En Yii3, la ruta de la plantilla es explícita en la acción:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/view', [\n"
"    'post' => $post,\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"return $this->viewRenderer->render(__DIR__ . '/view', [\n"
"    'post' => $post,\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii3 template receives a `Yiisoft\\View\\WebView` instance as `$this`:"
msgstr "Una plantilla de Yii3 recibe una instancia de `Yiisoft\\View\\WebView` como `$this`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var WebView $this\n"
" * @var ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var string $title\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$this->setTitle($title . ' - ' . $applicationParams->name);\n"
"?>\n"
"\n"
"<h1><?= Html::encode($title) ?></h1>\n"
msgstr ""
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Html\\Html;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\View\\WebView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var WebView $this\n"
" * @var ApplicationParams $applicationParams\n"
" * @var string $title\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"$this->setTitle($title . ' - ' . $applicationParams->name);\n"
"?>\n"
"\n"
"<h1><?= Html::encode($title) ?></h1>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Asset bundles move from `yii\\web\\AssetBundle` to `Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle`:"
msgstr "Los paquetes de assets pasan de `yii\\web\\AssetBundle` a `Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class MainAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets/main';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl/main';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = '@assetsSource/main';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'site.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class MainAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public ?string $basePath = '@assets/main';\n"
"    public ?string $baseUrl = '@assetsUrl/main';\n"
"    public ?string $sourcePath = '@assetsSource/main';\n"
"\n"
"    public array $css = [\n"
"        'site.css',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Register assets in a layout or view via the asset manager:"
msgstr "Registra los assets en un layout o una vista mediante el gestor de assets:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"
msgstr ""
"$assetManager->register(MainAsset::class);\n"
"\n"
"$this->addCssFiles($assetManager->getCssFiles());\n"
"$this->addJsFiles($assetManager->getJsFiles());\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Replace `yii\\helpers\\Url` and `Yii::$app->urlManager` usage with named routes and\n"
"`Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sustituye el uso de `yii\\helpers\\Url` y `Yii::$app->urlManager` por rutas con nombre y\n"
"`Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface`:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $post->getId()]);\n"
msgstr "$url = $urlGenerator->generate('post/view', ['id' => $post->getId()]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [View](../views/view.md), [Assets](../views/asset.md), [Scripts, styles and metatags](../views/script-style-meta.md), and [Template engines](../views/template-engines.md)."
msgstr "Consulta [Vistas](../views/view.md), [Assets](../views/asset.md), [Scripts, estilos y metaetiquetas](../views/script-style-meta.md) y [Motores de plantillas](../views/template-engines.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forms and validation"
msgstr "Formularios y validación"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 frequently combines form data, labels, validation, and sometimes persistence in a `yii\\base\\Model` or `yii\\db\\ActiveRecord` class:"
msgstr "Yii 2.0 a menudo combina los datos del formulario, las etiquetas, la validación y, a veces, la persistencia en una clase `yii\\base\\Model` o `yii\\db\\ActiveRecord`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class ContactForm extends \\yii\\base\\Model\n"
"{\n"
"    public $name;\n"
"    public $email;\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['name', 'email'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['email', 'email'],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class ContactForm extends \\yii\\base\\Model\n"
"{\n"
"    public $name;\n"
"    public $email;\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['name', 'email'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['email', 'email'],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 separates these concerns. Use `yiisoft/form-model` for form data and metadata, and `yiisoft/validator` for rules:"
msgstr "Yii3 separa estas responsabilidades. Usa `yiisoft/form-model` para los datos y metadatos del formulario, y `yiisoft/validator` para las reglas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "For form rendering, replace `yii\\widgets\\ActiveForm` with `yiisoft/form` fields and form model integration. For input hydration, prefer the form-model and hydrator packages instead of mass-assigning arbitrary request data to persistence objects."
msgstr "Para renderizar formularios, sustituye `yii\\widgets\\ActiveForm` por los campos de `yiisoft/form` y su integración con los modelos de formulario. Para hidratar la entrada, es preferible usar los paquetes form-model e hydrator en lugar de asignar de forma masiva datos arbitrarios de la solicitud a objetos de persistencia."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Active Record and persistence"
msgstr "Active Record y persistencia"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "There are two common Yii3 choices for code that used Yii 2.0 Active Record classes."
msgstr "Hay dos opciones habituales en Yii3 para el código que usaba clases Active Record de Yii 2.0."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The first path is architectural: move business logic to services and domain objects, then use repositories for persistence. This is recommended when the Yii 2.0 model contains validation, form scenarios, authorization checks, mailing, file uploads, and database access in the same class."
msgstr "El primer camino es arquitectónico: traslada la lógica de negocio a servicios y objetos de dominio, y después usa repositorios para la persistencia. Es lo recomendable cuando el modelo de Yii 2.0 contiene en la misma clase validación, escenarios de formulario, comprobaciones de autorización, envío de correo, subida de archivos y acceso a la base de datos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "The second path is incremental: represent the database model with [yiisoft/active-record](https://github.com/yiisoft/active-record). This is closer to Yii 2.0 and can be significantly faster when your Active Record classes mostly describe tables and relations."
msgstr "El segundo camino es incremental: representa el modelo de la base de datos con [yiisoft/active-record](https://github.com/yiisoft/active-record). Se parece más a Yii 2.0 y puede ser bastante más rápido cuando tus clases Active Record se limitan sobre todo a describir tablas y relaciones."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0:"
msgstr "Yii 2.0:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class Post extends \\yii\\db\\ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    public static function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['title', 'body'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['title', 'string', 'max' => 255],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class Post extends \\yii\\db\\ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    public static function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function rules(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            [['title', 'body'], 'required'],\n"
"            ['title', 'string', 'max' => 255],\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 Active Record:"
msgstr "Active Record de Yii3:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\ActiveRecord\\ActiveRecord;\n"
"\n"
"final class Post extends ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    protected int $id;\n"
"    protected string $title;\n"
"    protected string $body;\n"
"\n"
"    public function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getId(): ?int\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->id ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getTitle(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->title ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function setTitle(string $title): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $this->title = $title;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\ActiveRecord\\ActiveRecord;\n"
"\n"
"final class Post extends ActiveRecord\n"
"{\n"
"    protected int $id;\n"
"    protected string $title;\n"
"    protected string $body;\n"
"\n"
"    public function tableName(): string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return '{{%post}}';\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getId(): ?int\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->id ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getTitle(): ?string\n"
"    {\n"
"        return $this->title ?? null;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function setTitle(string $title): void\n"
"    {\n"
"        $this->title = $title;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Do not move Yii 2.0 `rules()` directly into the Active Record class. In Yii3, validation belongs to validator rules, form models, command objects, or services:"
msgstr "No traslades `rules()` de Yii 2.0 directamente a la clase Active Record. En Yii3, la validación corresponde a las reglas del validador, los modelos de formulario, los objetos de comando o los servicios:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class PostInput extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(max: 255)]\n"
"    public ?string $title = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?string $body = null;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\FormModel\\FormModel;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Length;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Validator\\Rule\\Required;\n"
"\n"
"final class PostInput extends FormModel\n"
"{\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    #[Length(max: 255)]\n"
"    public ?string $title = null;\n"
"\n"
"    #[Required]\n"
"    public ?string $body = null;\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Then copy validated data into the record or pass it to an application service:"
msgstr "Después, copia los datos validados en el registro o pásalos a un servicio de la aplicación:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$post = new Post();\n"
"$post->setTitle($input->title);\n"
"$post->save();\n"
msgstr ""
"$post = new Post();\n"
"$post->setTitle($input->title);\n"
"$post->save();\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "When deciding what to reuse, check each Active Record method:"
msgstr "Para decidir qué reutilizar, revisa cada método de Active Record:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "table mapping and relations can usually move to `yiisoft/active-record`;"
msgstr "el mapeo de tablas y las relaciones normalmente pueden pasar a `yiisoft/active-record`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "validation should move to `yiisoft/validator`;"
msgstr "la validación debe pasar a `yiisoft/validator`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "form labels and hints should move to `yiisoft/form-model`;"
msgstr "las etiquetas y los textos de ayuda de los formularios deben pasar a `yiisoft/form-model`;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "search models should become query/data-reader services;"
msgstr "los modelos de búsqueda deben convertirse en servicios de consulta o de lectura de datos;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "business workflows should become services;"
msgstr "los flujos de negocio deben convertirse en servicios;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "events should use PSR-14 events or package-specific events;"
msgstr "los eventos deben usar eventos PSR-14 o eventos específicos del paquete;"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "direct `Yii::$app->db` usage should become injected database dependencies."
msgstr "el uso directo de `Yii::$app->db` debe convertirse en dependencias de base de datos inyectadas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 migrations and Yii3 `yiisoft/db-migration` migrations are not compatible. Start a new migration history or create structure dumps for the current schema, then use Yii3 migrations for future schema changes."
msgstr "Las migraciones de Yii 2.0 y las migraciones de `yiisoft/db-migration` de Yii3 no son compatibles. Empieza un nuevo historial de migraciones o crea volcados de la estructura del esquema actual y, después, usa las migraciones de Yii3 para los futuros cambios del esquema."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 `GridView` is commonly used with `ActiveDataProvider`:"
msgstr "En Yii 2.0, `GridView` se usa habitualmente con `ActiveDataProvider`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use yii\\grid\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget([\n"
"    'dataProvider' => $dataProvider,\n"
"    'filterModel' => $searchModel,\n"
"    'columns' => [\n"
"        'id',\n"
"        'title',\n"
"        'created_at:datetime',\n"
"        ['class' => 'yii\\grid\\ActionColumn'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"]);\n"
msgstr ""
"use yii\\grid\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget([\n"
"    'dataProvider' => $dataProvider,\n"
"    'filterModel' => $searchModel,\n"
"    'columns' => [\n"
"        'id',\n"
"        'title',\n"
"        'created_at:datetime',\n"
"        ['class' => 'yii\\grid\\ActionColumn'],\n"
"    ],\n"
"]);\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 uses [yiisoft/yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview). It renders data from a data reader and uses fluent widget configuration:"
msgstr "Yii3 usa [yiisoft/yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview). Renderiza datos a partir de un lector de datos (data reader) y usa una configuración fluida del widget:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Data\\Reader\\ReadableDataInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\Column\\DataColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\Column\\ActionColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var ReadableDataInterface $dataReader\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title', header: 'Title'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('created_at', header: 'Created'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(),\n"
"    );\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Data\\Reader\\ReadableDataInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\Column\\DataColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\Column\\ActionColumn;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\GridView\\GridView;\n"
"\n"
"/**\n"
" * @var ReadableDataInterface $dataReader\n"
" */\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title', header: 'Title'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('created_at', header: 'Created'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(),\n"
"    );\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "For sorting, pagination, filtering, and action URLs, wire the widget to Yii Router:"
msgstr "Para la ordenación, la paginación, el filtrado y las URL de las acciones, conecta el widget con Yii Router:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlConfig;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlParameterProvider;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->urlParameterProvider(new UrlParameterProvider($currentRoute))\n"
"    ->urlCreator(new UrlCreator($urlGenerator))\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(\n"
"            urlCreator: new ActionColumnUrlCreator($urlGenerator, $currentRoute),\n"
"            urlConfig: new ActionColumnUrlConfig(baseRouteName: 'post'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"    );\n"
msgstr ""
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlConfig;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\ActionColumnUrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlCreator;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\DataView\\YiiRouter\\UrlParameterProvider;\n"
"\n"
"echo GridView::widget()\n"
"    ->dataReader($dataReader)\n"
"    ->urlParameterProvider(new UrlParameterProvider($currentRoute))\n"
"    ->urlCreator(new UrlCreator($urlGenerator))\n"
"    ->columns(\n"
"        new DataColumn('id'),\n"
"        new DataColumn('title'),\n"
"        new ActionColumn(\n"
"            urlCreator: new ActionColumnUrlCreator($urlGenerator, $currentRoute),\n"
"            urlConfig: new ActionColumnUrlConfig(baseRouteName: 'post'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"    );\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "A Yii 2.0 search model usually becomes a query service that:"
msgstr "Un modelo de búsqueda de Yii 2.0 suele convertirse en un servicio de consulta que:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "reads filter and sort parameters from the request;"
msgstr "lee los parámetros de filtrado y ordenación de la solicitud;"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "validates them with `yiisoft/validator`;"
msgstr "los valida con `yiisoft/validator`;"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "builds a database query or repository query;"
msgstr "construye una consulta a la base de datos o al repositorio;"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "exposes a data reader to GridView."
msgstr "expone un lector de datos al GridView."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "See [Using htmx for partial reloads](../../cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md) for a complete Yii3 GridView workflow and [yii-dataview GridView docs](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview/blob/master/docs/en/guide/gridview.md)."
msgstr "Consulta [Usar htmx para recargas parciales](../../cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md) para ver un flujo completo de GridView en Yii3, y la [documentación de GridView de yii-dataview](https://github.com/yiisoft/yii-dataview/blob/master/docs/en/guide/gridview.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filters, middleware, and access control"
msgstr "Filtros, middleware y control de acceso"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 controller filters and behaviors usually look like this:"
msgstr "Los filtros y comportamientos (behaviors) de los controladores de Yii 2.0 suelen tener este aspecto:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public function behaviors(): array\n"
"{\n"
"    return [\n"
"        'access' => [\n"
"            'class' => \\yii\\filters\\AccessControl::class,\n"
"            'rules' => [\n"
"                ['allow' => true, 'roles' => ['@']],\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public function behaviors(): array\n"
"{\n"
"    return [\n"
"        'access' => [\n"
"            'class' => \\yii\\filters\\AccessControl::class,\n"
"            'rules' => [\n"
"                ['allow' => true, 'roles' => ['@']],\n"
"            ],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "In Yii3, request processing is middleware-based. Move cross-cutting concerns such as authentication, authorization, body parsing, locale negotiation, CSRF checks, and error handling to middleware or dedicated services. Keep actions focused on the request flow they implement."
msgstr "En Yii3, el procesamiento de las solicitudes se basa en middleware. Traslada las responsabilidades transversales, como la autenticación, la autorización, el análisis del cuerpo de la solicitud, la negociación del idioma (locale), las comprobaciones CSRF y el manejo de errores, a middlewares o servicios dedicados. Mantén las acciones centradas en el flujo de solicitud que implementan."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Console commands"
msgstr "Comandos de consola"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii 2.0 console commands extend `yii\\console\\Controller`:"
msgstr "Los comandos de consola de Yii 2.0 extienden `yii\\console\\Controller`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"final class ReportController extends \\yii\\console\\Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionSend(): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return self::EXIT_CODE_NORMAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"final class ReportController extends \\yii\\console\\Controller\n"
"{\n"
"    public function actionSend(): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return self::EXIT_CODE_NORMAL;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
msgid "Yii3 console commands are services in `src/Console`:"
msgstr "Los comandos de consola de Yii3 son servicios en `src/Console`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"namespace App\\Console;\n"
"\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Attribute\\AsCommand;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Command\\Command;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputInterface;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\OutputInterface;\n"
"\n"
"#[AsCommand(name: 'report/send')]\n"
"final class SendReportCommand extends Command\n"
"{\n"
"    protected function execute(InputInterface $input, OutputInterface $output): int\n"
"    {\n"
"        // ...\n"
"        return Command::SUCCESS;\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"namespace App\\Console;\n"
"\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Attribute\\AsCommand;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Command\\Command;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Input\\InputInterface;\n"
"use Symfony\\Component\\Console\\Output\\OutputInterface;\n"
"\n"
"#[AsCommand(name: 'report/send')]\n"
"final class SendReportCommand extends Command\n"
"{\n"
